    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ede53c77785a15071e99eaf4298fc539.poster.avif?t=1732810521\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ede53c77785a15071e99eaf4298fc539.apng?t=1732810521\" class=\"bb_img\" width=263 height=71 /></picture></span><br>A warm and whimsical cat adventure where you climb, talk, fly and smack your way to places where no cat has ever gone before!<br><br>Go on a short yet cosmic journey packed with curious characters, imaginative environments and good vibes. The game takes 30-60 minutes to finish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/5cb36e665d681d7aa86d3b8537a68da8.poster.avif?t=1732810521\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/5cb36e665d681d7aa86d3b8537a68da8.webm?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/5cb36e665d681d7aa86d3b8537a68da8.mp4?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/6adacffccf87f984b383815ac619a09c.poster.avif?t=1732810521\" width=251 height=67 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/6adacffccf87f984b383815ac619a09c.webm?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You play as a cat!<br></li><li>Talk, find items and use your abilities to go where no cat has ever gone before!<br></li><li>Meet a cast of entertaining characters<br></li><li>No combat, unless you count smacking stuff with a baseball bat<br></li><li>An imaginative world<br></li><li>Takes 30-60 minutes to finish: You'll experience a lot in a short time!<br></li><li>A jazzy soundtrack<br></li><li>Secret cat things for curious cats<br></li><li>Made by one person<br></li><li>Enjoy chunky pixelart, with a grand total of 8 colors!<br></li><li>Cat</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ea6787d07b2e84448a65d0cc19bc6163.poster.avif?t=1732810521\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ea6787d07b2e84448a65d0cc19bc6163.webm?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ea6787d07b2e84448a65d0cc19bc6163.mp4?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interested in gamedev?</h2>\u200bJoin my Discord server, it's a friendly place to talk about gamedev, share your creations and get feedback. There's also a channel for cat pictures! ",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ede53c77785a15071e99eaf4298fc539.poster.avif?t=1732810521\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ede53c77785a15071e99eaf4298fc539.apng?t=1732810521\" class=\"bb_img\" width=263 height=71 /></picture></span><br>A warm and whimsical cat adventure where you climb, talk, fly and smack your way to places where no cat has ever gone before!<br><br>Go on a short yet cosmic journey packed with curious characters, imaginative environments and good vibes. The game takes 30-60 minutes to finish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/5cb36e665d681d7aa86d3b8537a68da8.poster.avif?t=1732810521\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/5cb36e665d681d7aa86d3b8537a68da8.webm?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/5cb36e665d681d7aa86d3b8537a68da8.mp4?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/6adacffccf87f984b383815ac619a09c.poster.avif?t=1732810521\" width=251 height=67 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/6adacffccf87f984b383815ac619a09c.webm?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You play as a cat!<br></li><li>Talk, find items and use your abilities to go where no cat has ever gone before!<br></li><li>Meet a cast of entertaining characters<br></li><li>No combat, unless you count smacking stuff with a baseball bat<br></li><li>An imaginative world<br></li><li>Takes 30-60 minutes to finish: You'll experience a lot in a short time!<br></li><li>A jazzy soundtrack<br></li><li>Secret cat things for curious cats<br></li><li>Made by one person<br></li><li>Enjoy chunky pixelart, with a grand total of 8 colors!<br></li><li>Cat</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ea6787d07b2e84448a65d0cc19bc6163.poster.avif?t=1732810521\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ea6787d07b2e84448a65d0cc19bc6163.webm?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ea6787d07b2e84448a65d0cc19bc6163.mp4?t=1732810521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interested in gamedev?</h2>\u200bJoin my Discord server, it's a friendly place to talk about gamedev, share your creations and get feedback. There's also a channel for cat pictures! ",
